  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 302.07 Certification. Unless otherwise stated in these rules, all applications and documentation shall be signed by the applicant under the penalty of unsworn falsification pursuant to RSA 641:3.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.08)",
